company_description:
Forestown is a new-generation international company with immense experience in providing executive headhunting and human resources management consultation services. We registered our first office, built our team and started operating in November of 2015 in San Jose, America. In the following four years, we opened new branches in Beijing, China, and Hamburg, Germany to further develop simultaneously and cohesively. In August 2019, we reconstructed our structure collectively for all three branches under the need of our new strategy and officially renamed our organization as Forestown. Forestown have long been committed on combining our clients’ commercial strategies and talent strategies, helping clients to achieve remarkable developments and repelling clients’ statuses within their industries. With the backup of these basis and the accumulated experience throughout the years, we will be providing localized and customized comprehensive recruiting services globally. 

China (Beijing): Beijing Forestown International Human Resources Co., Ltd.(北京福睿思特国际人力资源有限公司) / Baihuan Building, 66 Guangqu Road, Chaoyang District;
U.S. (San Jose): Forestown International Consulting Inc. / 99 South Almaden Blvd, San Jose;
German(Hamburg): Forestown International Consulting GmbH / Stadthausbruecke 1-3; 
(In Germany)
Forestown interenational team verfügen über eine profunde Expertise bei Vertriebsaufbau und Führungskräfte- und Mitarbeiterschulung für Ihre Business, besonders für Internationales Geschäft.
